{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14108410","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14108410","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1410841001:0":{"text":"시초의 드래곤은 산맥과도 같이 거대합니다.","source_cn":"初始之龙的身躯如山峦般巨大。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6FF7227644C572FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1410841002:0":{"text":"이 거대한 존재가 몸을 펼치고 하늘로 날아오른다면 얼마나 압도적일까요.","source_cn":"这样的庞然巨物一旦舒展身躯，腾空而起，那该是多么震撼的景象。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD036608F15B8BAD9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1410841003:0":{"text":"이렇게 큰데 어떻게 날 수 있는 거지... 공기 역학적으로 말도 안 되는 구조야.","source_cn":"这么大，到底要怎么飞起来呢……根本不符合空气动力学——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88AAF29FB0E7A230","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1410841003":{"text":"이렇게 큰데 어떻게 날 수 있는 거지... 공기 역학적으로 말도 안 되는 구조야.","source_cn":"这么大，到底要怎么飞起来呢……根本不符合空气动力学——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88AAF29FB0E7A230","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1410841004:0":{"text":"흥, 이래서 논리를 무시하는 마법사들이 싫어! 언젠가는...","source_cn":"哼，真烦你们这些有了魔法就不讲常理的家伙！早晚有一天……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7DE629E86D6DC7B9","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"흥, 이래서 논리를 무시하는 마법사들이 싫어! 언젠가는...","female":"흥, 이래서 논리를 무시하는 마법사들이 싫어! 언젠가는...","variant_male_record_index":"158876","variant_female_record_index":"158877","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1410841005:0":{"text":"됐어! 그래서 드래곤을 상대할 계획은 있어?","source_cn":"先不提这个！你们有什么对付龙的方案吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4802A43DCC5136DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1410841006:0":{"text":"드래곤이 깨어나면 하품하는 것만으로도 재앙이 일어날 거라고!","source_cn":"这头龙一旦醒过来，光是打个哈欠都能引发天灾。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x426EA572A7DFF183","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1410841006":{"text":"드래곤이 깨어나면 하품하는 것만으로도 재앙이 일어날 거라고!","source_cn":"这头龙一旦醒过来，光是打个哈欠都能引发天灾。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x426EA572A7DFF183","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1410841007:0":{"text":"진심이야? 너희도 봤지만, 그건 소리만 요란하다고!","source_cn":"认真的吗？你们也看到过，它只能听个响！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x906FB566EC70B2AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1410841008:0":{"text":"그건 드래곤이 잠들어있을 때의 이야기입니다. 만약 깨어난다면...","source_cn":"那只是对付沉睡的龙，如果龙醒了的话……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF6B4C83FAD57577A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1410841009:0":{"text":"알았어, 알았어! 나도 나 자신을 좀 더 믿어 볼게!","source_cn":"好吧好吧！我也该对自己有点信心！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x18BACD0B5385B40B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1410841015:0":{"text":"이 정도면 준비가 된 것 같은데?","source_cn":"这么看来，还是有点准备嘛！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE9DB9266B46B2B1C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1410841016:0":{"text":"그럼 드래곤의 약점은 뭐지?","source_cn":"那么龙呢？龙有什么弱点吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98460D3C768F849A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:14:1410841016":{"text":"그럼 드래곤의 약점은 뭐지?","source_cn":"那么龙呢？龙有什么弱点吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98460D3C768F849A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1410841017:0":{"text":"...드래곤의 눈을 보는 순간 우리는 이미 잿더미가 되어 있을 것 같은데!","source_cn":"……等看到眼睛的时候，我们就已经被烧焦了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7565BE86AF4E4EFC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:14:0:1":{"text":"눈","source_cn":"眼睛","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x65863BF8B3E2D9F4","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"눈","female":"눈","variant_male_record_index":"71718","variant_female_record_index":"71719","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1410841018:0":{"text":"그게 진짜 약점이야? 드래곤이 살짝 움직이는 것만으로도 우린 한참 피해야 할 텐데!","source_cn":"这真的是弱点吗？她随便动一下我们都得躲半天！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDDFF9E2A4535F46B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1410841019:0":{"text":"멀린의 뜻은, 드래곤의 몸집이 너무 커서 행동에 제약이 있다는 말일 겁니다.","source_cn":"我想，梅林的意思是龙的体型也会限制她的行动。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3D9F3B4ED9B31E35","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"멀린의 뜻은, 드래곤의 몸집이 너무 커서 행동에 제약이 있다는 말일 겁니다.","female":"멀린의 뜻은, 드래곤의 몸집이 너무 커서 행동에 제약이 있다는 말일 겁니다.","variant_male_record_index":"158893","variant_female_record_index":"158894","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1410841020:0":{"text":"특히 이런 특별한 공간에서는 더요.","source_cn":"尤其是在这种特殊的空间里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD0EAE21786500574","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:14:1:2":{"text":"거대한 몸집","source_cn":"体型庞大","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x68A743EF3FE73F72","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"거대한 몸집","female":"거대한 몸집","variant_male_record_index":"71720","variant_female_record_index":"71721","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1410841021:0":{"text":"맞아. 분명 우리와 같은 작은 존재들을 얕보겠지.","source_cn":"确实，那家伙肯定对我们这些小生物看不上眼。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21BD6C26E4AB08DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1410841022:0":{"text":"허점을 보이는 순간, 저희에게는 기회가 될 겁니다.","source_cn":"她轻敌之际，就是我们的机会。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC3D1D346E6831279","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:14:2:3":{"text":"오만","source_cn":"傲慢","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE31A4CDD8577482A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"오만","female":"오만","variant_male_record_index":"71722","variant_female_record_index":"71723","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1410841023:0":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">역린</style>? 그건 들어본 적이 있어!","source_cn":"<style=highlight>逆鳞</style>...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7784E05A5F450C1D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1410841024:0":{"text":"드래곤의 목 부분에 거꾸로 자라는 비늘 한 조각...","source_cn":"传说中巨龙的头部以下咽喉处有一块逆生长的鳞片——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x56DCE02C3779D66E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1410841025:0":{"text":"그게 드래곤의 유일한 급소라는 이야기 말이야.","source_cn":"那是龙唯一的要害。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B998993EB7E201F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1410841026:0":{"text":"만약... 드래곤이 우리의 말을 듣지 않으려고 하면 거길 노려야 해!","source_cn":"万一……她根本不愿意听我们的辩解。就瞄准那里吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE25225DE1490DF7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1410841027:0":{"text":"네, 이제 준비가 끝난 것 같습니다.","source_cn":"嗯，我想，我已经准备好了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5ACC1FE34DE5AA2C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1410841028:0":{"text":"여기까지 오는 동안 저는 진실을 알고 싶었고, 속죄하며 모든 것을 바꿀 기회를 찾고 싶었습니다...","source_cn":"这一路走来，我想要知道真相，想要赎罪，想要寻找契机改变...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE6900967F7365C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1410841029:0":{"text":"하지만 결국 제가 원하는 건, 모두에게 새로운 가능성을 보여주고 에세일이 선택권을 갖게 하는 거였지요.","source_cn":"但最终，我只想为众人展现另一种可能性，让艾塞勒们拥有做...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x87FD6925EED189BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1410841030:0":{"text":"시초의 드래곤도 예외는 아닙니다. 드래곤도 진실을 알고 스스로 결정을 내려야 해요.","source_cn":"初始之龙也不例外。她应该知晓真相，做出自己的选择。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24CD0C9D07DBF20A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1410841031:0":{"text":"무엇에도 흔들리지 않는 자세, 목표를 향한 흔들림 없는 집념...","source_cn":"对一切事物都绝无分别的态度。对目标毫无动摇的执着……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7CC55BC38F3F5BDC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1410841032:0":{"text":"그 굳건한 결의는 산과 같고, 뜨거운 의지는 불꽃과 같지...","source_cn":"这份如山岩般坚定的决心，如烈火般灼热的意志……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA745A945C65999BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1410841033:0":{"text":"인듀어, 둔가엘을 당겨! 우리의 기대를 저버리지 마!","source_cn":"因度厄，拉开杜恩加尔吧！别让我们失望！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD368F419963B7A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:14:3:4":{"text":"역린도 있어","source_cn":"还有逆鳞","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4A7322E6F6BCBD3F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"역린도 있어","female":"역린도 있어","variant_male_record_index":"71724","variant_female_record_index":"71725","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:0:1":{"text":"네 대포","source_cn":"你的炮台","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xCBFDF94D7D2D6B61","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"네 대포","female":"네 대포","variant_male_record_index":"71712","variant_female_record_index":"71713","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1410841010:0":{"text":"인듀어의 활이라고? 그건 우리 드워프의 신의 활, 둔가엘이야!","source_cn":"什么因度厄的弓？那是我们矮人的神弓——杜恩加尔！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81D3AEF2C5EA9BB9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1410841011:0":{"text":"윽... 잠깐 빌려준 거니까! 화살은 인듀어의 것이라고 해도 되겠지!","source_cn":"呃……暂时借出去的！箭矢倒是可以算因度厄的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9319CCA140CE884D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1410841012:0":{"text":"네, 둔가엘과 제 화살로.","source_cn":"嗯，杜恩加尔和我的箭矢。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB3545DADC9C6FC91","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"네, 둔가엘과 제 화살로.","female":"네, 둔가엘과 제 화살로.","variant_male_record_index":"158885","variant_female_record_index":"158886","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:1:2":{"text":"인듀어의 활과 화살","source_cn":"因度厄的弓箭","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7A0C1C286B966D24","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"인듀어의 활과 화살","female":"인듀어의 활과 화살","variant_male_record_index":"71714","variant_female_record_index":"71715","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1410841013:0":{"text":"그럼 너에게 전부 맡겨야겠네!","source_